SUMMARY:2026 Bulgarian presidential election
DESCRIPTION:Presidential elections were held in Bulgaria on 25 October 2026
 \, with a second round held on 1 November 2026 after no candidate received
  a majority of the vote in the first round. Incumbent president Iliana Iot
 ova was eligible to run for a full 5 year term. In the end\, she won the e
 lection with 57.6% of the votes against Andrey Gurov's 39.5%. She became t
 he first woman elected president of Bulgaria.\n\nElection: Bulgaria\nSourc
 e: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Bulgarian_presidential_election\nTex
