DESCRIPTION:The 2026 Commonwealth Heads of Government Meeting\, also known 
 as CHOGM 2026\, was the 28th Commonwealth Heads of Government Meeting\, br
 inging together leaders and representatives of the 56 member states of the
  Commonwealth of Nations. It was held in St. John's\, Antigua and Barbuda\
 , from 3 to 4 November 2026\, with associated events taking place from 1 N
 ovember.\n\nSummit: Antigua and Barbuda\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/
