DESCRIPTION:Elections were held on November 3\, 2026\, to elect members of 
 the United States Senate for the 120th Congress. Thirty-three Class 2 seat
 s out of the 100 Senate seats were up for election\, along with special el
 ections in Florida and Ohio. The opposition Democratic Caucus defeated the
  Republican majority. The Democratic Caucus secured 56 seats—their large
 st post-election majority since the 2008 elections.\n\nElection: United St
 ates\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_Senate_elec
