DESCRIPTION:The 2026 New Zealand general election was held on 7 November 20
 26 to determine the composition of the 55th Parliament of New Zealand. Vot
 ers elected 130 members to the House of Representatives under the mixed-me
 mber proportional (MMP) voting system\, comprising 71 members elected from
  single-member electorates and 59 members elected from closed party lists 
