SUMMARY:2026 United Nations Climate Change Conference (Turkey)
DESCRIPTION:The 2026 United Nations Climate Change Conference or Conference
  of the Parties to the UNFCCC\, more commonly known as COP31\, was held at
  the Expo Center in Antalya\, Turkey. It was the 31st session of the Unite
 d Nations Climate Change Conference\, part of the United Nations Framework
  Convention on Climate Change (UNFCCC). Talks were scheduled to take place
  from 9 to 20 November 2026 but overran due to the failure to agree a deal
 .\n\nSummit: Turkey\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_Nat
 ions_Climate_Change_Conference\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitru
