SUMMARY:Nvidia announces the resignation of Jensen Huang as president and c
 hief executive\, effective 11 November (United States)
DESCRIPTION:Nvidia announces that its board accepted the resignation of Jen
 sen Huang as president\, chief executive and a director on 11 November\, e
 ffective immediately\, following reports of two extramarital affairs\, one
  of them with a woman initially suspected of being a Chinese intelligence 
 agent. Chief financial officer Colette Kress becomes interim chief executi
 ve. On 23 November Nvidia announced that its board had reinstated him as p
 resident\, chief executive and a director.\n\nResignation: United States\n
 Reported by AFP: https://www.afp.com/en/nvidia-ceo-jensen-huang-resigns\nS
 ource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jensen_Huang\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-
 SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
