DESCRIPTION:The 2026 ASEAN Summits were a series of two diplomatic conferen
 ces centering on the Association of Southeast Asian Nations (ASEAN)\, whic
 h were held in the Philippines in 2026. It comprised the 48th ASEAN Summit
  held on May 6–8 in Cebu and the 49th ASEAN Summit held on November 15
 –17 in Metro Manila.\n\nSummit: Philippines\nSource: https://en.wikipedi
