 ests against the potential signing of a Pax Silica deal with the United St
 ates (Philippines)
DESCRIPTION:Philippine police arrest at least 287 people during nationwide 
 protests against the potential signing of a Pax Silica deal with the Unite
 d States coinciding with the 49th ASEAN Summit in Metro Manila. Police als
 o report that 15 officers sustained injuries during demonstrations.\n\nPro
 test: Philippines\nReported by GMA News Online: https://www.gmanetwork.com
