SUMMARY:APEC China 2026
DESCRIPTION:The APEC China 2026 was a year-long hosting of the Asia-Pacific
  Economic Cooperation (APEC) meetings\, which concluded with the APEC Econ
 omic Leaders' Meeting in November 2026. It will be the third time China ho
 sted the summit\, having previously hosted in 2001 and 2014. The sidelines
  of the meeting featured an unprecedented China–Russia–U.S. Summit\, w
 hich was issued by a joint statement.\n\nSummit: China\nSource: https://en
 .wikipedia.org/wiki/APEC_China_2026\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via 
