SUMMARY:MPR election of a new vice-president (Indonesia)
DESCRIPTION:This is an indirect vote\, not a popular election. On 2026-11-2
 3 President Prabowo submitted two candidates to MPR Speaker Ahmad Muzani: 
 Sugiono\, Coordinating Minister for Human Development and Culture\, and An
 di Amran Sulaiman\, Minister of Agriculture. The MPR will choose one of th
 em at a plenary session on 2026-12-11 to fill the vacancy left by Gibran's
  resignation on 12 November 2026. That person will serve the rest of the 2
 024–2029 term. Political Atlas\, checked 25 November 2026.\n\nElection: 
 Indonesia\nSource: https://political-atlas.pages.dev/#IDN\nText: Wikipedia
